Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:07.86,TL,,0,0,364,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Claire Liu has done it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刘婧文做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:11.65,TL,,0,0,0,,香港的这座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:13.93,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文等到了{\fs78}26{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:14.86,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}年前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.90,TL,,0,0,0,,她已经在温网的{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁及以下组夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:20.43,TL,,0,0,0,,还登上了这个组别的世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:22.18,TL,,0,0,0,,可从那座草地球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.20,TL,,0,0,0,,走到巡回赛单打首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:26.75,TL,,0,0,0,,中间还有一段很长的路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:30.52,TL,,0,0,0,,她出生在美国加州的千橡市 {\fs78}5{\fs68}岁时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.70,TL,,0,0,0,,开始跟随当地大学的网球教练练球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:36.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}14{\fs68}岁 她就拿到了第一座{\fs78}ITF{\fs68}职业
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:38.00,TL,,0,0,0,,赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.82,TL,,0,0,0,,网球很早就成了她的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.59,0:00:42.76,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}17{\fs68}岁那年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:45.58,TL,,0,0,0,,她先拿到法网同年龄组的女单亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.71,TL,,0,0,0,,又在温网走到决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:48.44,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:51.48,TL,,0,0,0,,对面是同样来自美国的安 李
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:54.39,TL,,0,0,0,,打到决胜盘 她终于赢了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:57.03,TL,,0,0,0,,这是{\fs78}25{\fs68}年来 美国球员第一次拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:00:59.78,TL,,0,0,0,,这个组别的温网女单冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.35,0:01:17.50,TL,,0,0,0,,登顶同年龄组的世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:20.83,TL,,0,0,0,,并没有替她打开成年赛场的每一道门
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:21.90,TL,,0,0,0,,同年的美网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.58,TL,,0,0,0,,她从资格赛连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}场进入正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:26.43,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮输给了段莹莹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:27.39,TL,,0,0,0,,此后几年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:30.47,TL,,0,0,0,,她仍要在资格赛和低级别职业赛之间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.47,0:01:32.65,TL,,0,0,0,,争取自己的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:38.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Not really, just because I'm playing against a lot older and more experienced players,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N没压力 对手更年长也更老练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:41.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so I felt like I didn't have anything to lose.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我觉得自己没什么可失去的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.65,0:01:43.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I just tried to play as free as possible.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就尽量放开去打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:45.32,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:47.95,TL,,0,0,0,,她第一次进入单打世界前{\fs78}100{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.95,0:01:48.62,TL,,0,0,0,,第二年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:52.28,TL,,0,0,0,,她先在巴黎拿到{\fs78}WTA125{\fs68}级别冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:53.24,TL,,0,0,0,,又在拉巴特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:55.87,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次打进巡回赛单打决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.87,0:01:57.87,TL,,0,0,0,,可是决赛面对特雷维桑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:02:01.84,TL,,0,0,0,,她只拿到{\fs78}3{\fs68}局 奖杯 还要继续等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:03.93,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年一月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.93,0:02:07.31,TL,,0,0,0,,她的单打排名最高来到世界第{\fs78}52{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:08.56,TL,,0,0,0,,这个数字背后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.88,TL,,0,0,0,,也有她后来公开讲过的另一面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:12.40,TL,,0,0,0,,原以为进入前{\fs78}100{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:14.59,TL,,0,0,0,,就会觉得自己已经做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.59,0:02:17.66,TL,,0,0,0,,真正走到那里 赛前的紧张与眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:19.86,TL,,0,0,0,,却没有自动消失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.63,0:02:22.95,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2024{\fs68}年的法网资格赛之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:24.45,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文暂停了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.45,0:02:26.42,TL,,0,0,0,,把时间留给心理健康
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:27.37,TL,,0,0,0,,那年{\fs78}9{\fs68}月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.37,0:02:30.32,TL,,0,0,0,,她在自己的博客里写下这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.54,TL,,0,0,0,,她原本还想继续打 继续试
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:35.17,TL,,0,0,0,,但教练和运动心理学家的建议
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:37.67,TL,,0,0,0,,让她开始认真考虑休息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:41.24,TL,,0,0,0,,重返赛场 也有新的难关
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:44.42,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年 她与合作多年的教练分开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.42,0:02:47.61,TL,,0,0,0,,排名一度跌出世界前{\fs78}400{\fs68} 后来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:50.52,TL,,0,0,0,,她开始和克莱门斯 瓦格纳合作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:53.73,TL,,0,0,0,,到秋天的广州 当时排名{\fs78}305{\fs68}的她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.20,TL,,0,0,0,,从资格赛打到了四强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:58.56,TL,,0,0,0,,她也在写作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:02:59.70,TL,,0,0,0,,每天记日记
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.62,TL,,0,0,0,,把赛前的焦虑和脑子里的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.93,TL,,0,0,0,,想法一点点整理出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.21,TL,,0,0,0,,她把自己的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:07.08,TL,,0,0,0,,和英文里清晰这个词
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:09.15,TL,,0,0,0,,拼成了博客的标题
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:10.07,TL,,0,0,0,,球场之外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:13.36,TL,,0,0,0,,她在学习怎样更好地理解自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.84,TL,,0,0,0,,今年{\fs78}5{\fs68}月 在斯洛伐克的特尔纳瓦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.68,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿到两年来第一座单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:21.81,TL,,0,0,0,,那是一站{\fs78}ITF{\fs68}赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.00,TL,,0,0,0,,随后来到法网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:25.88,TL,,0,0,0,,她又从资格赛打起 走进正赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.98,TL,,0,0,0,,排名 胜场 信心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:30.61,TL,,0,0,0,,都在一点点重新积累
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.40,TL,,0,0,0,,到了温网 她连过资格赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:36.39,TL,,0,0,0,,再打进生涯第一次大满贯第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:39.01,TL,,0,0,0,,那天早上 她的酒店住宿到期
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:40.36,TL,,0,0,0,,只能先退房
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:42.95,TL,,0,0,0,,赢球后 又得重新找住处
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:44.93,TL,,0,0,0,,男友提醒她 收拾行李
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:47.63,TL,,0,0,0,,并不代表你就要离开比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.40,0:03:51.84,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}年前 她在这里拿过同年龄组冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.84,0:03:55.17,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}年后 第一次站上成年组第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.14,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 年轻时的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:59.77,TL,,0,0,0,,反而会比现在更相信这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:01.97,TL,,0,0,0,,她仍在学习把信心找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.07,TL,,0,0,0,,也学着接受 比赛的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.07,0:04:06.81,TL,,0,0,0,,无法完全由自己控制
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.57,0:04:09.48,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月 她又在巴兰基亚拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:12.80,TL,,0,0,0,,一座{\fs78}WTA125{\fs68}级别冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:15.29,TL,,0,0,0,,所以 香港这次 准确地说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.54,TL,,0,0,0,,是巡回赛单打首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:19.12,TL,,0,0,0,,她已经拿过不少奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:22.12,TL,,0,0,0,,这一座 却有不同的分量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:25.89,TL,,0,0,0,,一周前的广州 她止步八强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:29.78,TL,,0,0,0,,来到香港时 她的世界排名是{\fs78}102{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:31.76,TL,,0,0,0,,首轮击败普罗佐罗娃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:33.36,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮战胜博尔特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:35.47,TL,,0,0,0,,再过森梅兹这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:37.28,TL,,0,0,0,,来到赛季末的这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:40.19,TL,,0,0,0,,她把胜利一场接一场留了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:50.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Claire Liu, quietly but devastatingly,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刘婧文不声不响 却势不可挡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:55.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}making her way into a first semifinal on tour in just over 12 months.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}1{\fs68}年多来首次打进巡回赛{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.28,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛面对舒布拉泽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:01.59,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘打到五平 她随后连赢两局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:03.90,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 时隔{\fs78}4{\fs68}年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.76,TL,,0,0,0,,她又一次打进巡回赛单打决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.63,TL,,0,0,0,,从{\fs78}21{\fs68}岁时的拉巴特
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:10.32,TL,,0,0,0,,到{\fs78}26{\fs68}岁时的香港
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.45,TL,,0,0,0,,终于有了第二次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:28.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Now it's only one point. She's almost there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在只差{\fs78}1{\fs68}分 她快做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:41.37,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, prior to this year, Claire Liu had never won a match in Hong Kong.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今年之前 她在香港没赢过球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:42.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now she's in the final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N如今她已经打进了决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:46.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Clemens Wagner on his feet.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦格纳站了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:51.57,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Claire Liu will be delighted.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刘婧文一定很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:55.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Her first final since Rabat in 2022.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是{\fs78}2022{\fs68}拉巴特后的首个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's had a fabulous week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她这一周打得太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:04.21,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And now the smile is there for all to see.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在大家都能看到她的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:05.86,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:08.44,TL,,0,0,0,,是世界排名第{\fs78}17{\fs68}的伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.44,0:06:10.30,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.38,TL,,0,0,0,,伊埃拉叫了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:15.37,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛继续 她也坚持打到了最后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:17.27,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文拿下首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.30,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘又建立起领先
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:21.61,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 她要把自己的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.75,TL,,0,0,0,,保持到比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:28.27,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 刘婧文发球 {\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:30.95,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 距离巡回赛单打冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:32.67,TL,,0,0,0,,只差最后一分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}17{\fs68}岁赢温网的那个女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:36.69,TL,,0,0,0,,如今站在这里 {\fs78}26{\fs68}岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.69,0:06:38.70,TL,,0,0,0,,准备再发一个球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.08,0:06:48.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Claire Liu has done it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刘婧文做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:53.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has her first main tour title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她拿下了巡回赛单打首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Coach is on his feet.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N教练已经站了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:01.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Eala offers her congratulations.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉向她表示祝贺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.97,0:07:04.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It wasn't to be for her today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天胜利没有属于伊埃拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.42,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ladies and gentlemen,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:12.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the champion of the 2026 Prudential Hong Kong Tennis Open, Claire Liu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}2026{\fs68}香港公开赛冠军 刘婧文
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:13.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A worthy winner.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当之无愧的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.87,0:07:16.14,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Few can argue with that.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一点没有什么争议
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:19.06,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}场胜利 一盘未失
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:22.30,TL,,0,0,0,,刘婧文终于拿到巡回赛单打首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:24.78,TL,,0,0,0,,那个{\fs78}17{\fs68}岁在温网赢球的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:27.97,TL,,0,0,0,,经历过暂停 也经历过重新出发
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:30.73,TL,,0,0,0,,今天 她亲吻了这只奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:33.91,TL,,0,0,0,,这个故事里 你更佩服夺冠的那一分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:37.14,TL,,0,0,0,,还是那些把自己带回球场的日子？
